					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I intend to come on the raid Saturday in Droga. However, you cannot hold me to this. I am not sure if I will be finished with work in time to attend. You may want to look into bringing along another rezzing cleric just to be safe. <br />
<br />
