					<div class="xsmall">2/14/2002 - 1:56 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2769">Ziksis</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2770">Tfuunk Mastablaasta</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hey Pomoxis, I hope you can make it. Droga is a fun zone to play in. If everyone sticks together it can be done in a safe manner without any deaths. It would be nice if some porters can make it but not entirely necessary. The exit is fairly easy to find.						</td>
					</tr>
