					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2825">Aprilmoon Swiftarrow</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2951">Questorsmuse</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I will try to attend as well but as you all know I spend most of my weekends working on wedding planning because I get to tired during the week to deal with it all.  I am having so much fun with it :)  I will try my best to be there though.<br />
<br />
Never been there.  Could you tell me what level place it is and what we will be after?						</td>
